cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use kpnn2 in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "kpnn2: Sparse named neural nets from an edgelist, as native PyTorch primitives"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Rauter"
    given-names: "Thomas"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5578-3628"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Thomas-Rauter/kpnn2"
url: "https://thomas-rauter.github.io/kpnn2/"
abstract: "kpnn2 turns a source/target edgelist into a GraphSpec (masks, layer names, skip list) so the user writes ordinary PyTorch with MaskedLinear. It is not a graph compiler."
keywords:
  - pytorch
  - sparse-neural-networks
  - graph-defined-neural-networks
  - knowledge-primed-neural-networks
license: "MIT"
